 "titulo": {
  "estudio": "¿Y si fuéramos?",
  "alumno": "What if we went?"
 },
 "intro": "Tentative suggestions with the conditional and the imperfect subjunctive, and elegant ways to accept or decline.",
 "palabras": [
  {
   "palabra": "sugerencia",
   "significado": "suggestion",
   "pron": "su-he-REN-thya",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "f",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is feminine: «una sugerencia». It comes from «sugerir», where the e becomes ie: «sugiero».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "estaría bien que",
   "significado": "it would be good if…",
   "pron": "es-ta-RI-a byen ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It takes the imperfect subjunctive: «estaría bien que vinieras». It sounds softer than «tienes que venir».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "no estaría mal que",
   "significado": "it would not be bad if…",
   "pron": "no es-ta-RI-a mal ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is a discreet compliment: the idea is liked. It takes the imperfect subjunctive: «no estaría mal que fuéramos».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "habría que",
   "significado": "one ought to, we should",
   "pron": "a-BRI-a ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is impersonal and takes an infinitive: «habría que reservar». It suggests without ordering. The h is silent.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "te propongo que",
   "significado": "I suggest that…",
   "pron": "te pro-PON-go ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It takes the present subjunctive: «te propongo que cenemos». «Propongo» comes from «proponer».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "cómo lo ves",
   "significado": "how does that look to you?",
   "pron": "KO-mo lo bes",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is asked after giving a plan. It is very common among friends and colleagues.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "otra posibilidad sería",
   "significado": "another possibility would be",
   "pron": "O-tra po-si-bi-li-DAD se-RI-a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "An infinitive follows: «otra posibilidad sería alquilar un coche». The conditional softens the idea.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "me temo que",
   "significado": "I am afraid that",
   "pron": "me TE-mo ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It announces bad news politely: «me temo que no puedo». Here «temer» does not mean to be scared.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "qué rabia",
   "significado": "how annoying!",
   "pron": "ke RRA-bya",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is colloquial. It expresses annoyance or sadness about something not going as you wanted.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "preferiría",
   "significado": "I would prefer",
   "pron": "pre-fe-ri-RI-a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "verb",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is the conditional of «preferir» and sounds courteous: «preferiría esperar». With yo in the present: «prefiero».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "animarse a",
   "significado": "to feel like joining in",
   "pron": "a-ni-MAR-se a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "verb",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is pronominal and takes «a»: «me animo a ir». It also works to cheer someone on: «¡anímate!».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "apetecer",
   "significado": "to feel like, to appeal",
